// PARAM: --analysis interval
// Straight-line arithmetic, one exact write, one check.
// See 07-sign-precision/01-straight_line_sign_limitation.vimp for the same
// program under Sign, which is UNKNOWN there -- a known limitation (#99),
// not asserted here as Interval's behavior.
void main() {
  x := 5;
  __voblint_check(0 < x) // PROVED
}
